bb-tui is derived from TaskYou (https://github.com/bborn/taskyou).

The terminal UI, its data types, and the supporting packages under internal/
originate in that project and are used here under the MIT License reproduced in
LICENSE. Import paths were rewritten from github.com/bborn/workflow to
github.com/bborn/bb-tui, and the data layer was replaced: where TaskYou reads a
local SQLite database, bb-tui reads bb's HTTP and WebSocket API.
